---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Check keys.toml and name everything mxr would ignore in it

Usage: mxr keys check [OPTIONS] [FILE]

Arguments:
  [FILE]  The file to check; defaults to keys.toml beside your config

Options:
      --client <CLIENT>    Only this client's keys [possible values: tui, web]
      --context <CONTEXT>  Only keys live in this place: a TUI context or web scope, such as todo
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
